e in every version:\\\\n- The glass fruit is perfectly centered on a clean wooden cutting board\\\\n- Studio lighting with subtle glowing highlights on the transparent jelly surface\\\\n- A clearly visible human hand (neutral skin tone) holds a sharp stainless steel knife just above the fruit, poised to slice\\\\n- Shot in ultra-sharp macro lens style with very shallow depth of field\\\\n- Cinematic lighting, soft bokeh background, 4K quality, 30 FPS\\\\n- In beautiful slow motion, the knife performs exactly two clean slices: First slice: front section breaks off cleanly with delicate jelly-crack and soft slicing ASMR sounds. Immediately after: second slice cuts another smooth piece.\\\\n- A few tiny transparent jelly shards scatter lightly from both cuts\\\\n- Only ASMR sounds: crisp jelly-glass cutting, subtle cracking, small shards falling — absolutely no talking, no voice, no background music, no other sound effects\\\\n- Only the hand, knife, fruit and board are visible — nothing else enters the frame\\\\n\\\\nImportant: Choose a completely different realistic fruit each time (never repeat). Pick randomly from: kiwi, dragon fruit, persimmon, fig, lychee, passion fruit, starfruit, guava, pomegranate, apricot, plum, peach, mango, pear, strawberry, jackfruit, longan, mangosteen, feijoa, kumquat, papaya, carambola, salak, tamarind, soursop, santol, marang, langsat.\\\\n\\\\nRespond ONLY with a valid JSON object. No markdown, no backticks, no commentary, no extra text before or after. Only raw JSON:\\\\n{\\\\\\"prompt\\\\\\":\\\\\\"<full detailed video generation prompt here>\\\\\\",\\\\\\"videoTitle\\\\\\":\\\\\\"<5-10 word clickbait clean English title>\\\\\\",\\\\\\"videoDescription\\\\\\":\\\\\\"<1-2 sentence engaging English caption with 2-4 relevant hashtags>\\\\\\"}\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\"generationConfig\\": {\\n    \\"temperature\\": 1.0,\\n    \\"maxOutputTokens\\": 1024,\\n    \\"responseMimeType\\": \\"application/json\\"\\n  }\\n}","options":{},"infoMessage":""},"id":"6ba1b945-f270-4980-ac42-23f2404be668","name":"Gemini – Generate Prompt","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.2,"position":[-1104,640]},{"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","language":"javaScript","jsCode":"// Parse Gemini response and extract the JSON content\\nconst geminiResponse = $input.item.json;\\n\\n// Gemini returns content inside candidates[0].content.parts[0].text\\nlet rawText = '';\\ntry {\\n  rawText = geminiResponse.candidates[0].content.parts[0].text;\\n} catch(e) {\\n  throw new Error('Could not read Gemini response: ' + JSON.stringify(geminiResponse));\\n}\\n\\n// Clean up in case Gemini wraps in backticks despite instructions\\nrawText = rawText.replace(/```json/g, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();\\n\\n// Parse the JSON\\nlet parsed;\\ntry {\\n  parsed = JSON.parse(rawText);\\n} catch(e) {\\n  throw new Error('Failed to parse JSON from Gemini: ' + rawText);\\n}\\n\\n// Validate required fields\\nif (!parsed.prompt || !parsed.videoTitle || !parsed.videoDescription) {\\n  throw new Error('Missing required fields in Gemini response: ' + rawText);\\n}\\n\\nconst today = new Date();\\nconst dateStr = today.toISOString().split('T')[0];\\nconst timeStr = today.toISOString();\\n\\nreturn [{\\n  json: {\\n    prompt: parsed.prompt,\\n    videoTitle: parsed.videoTitle,\\n    videoDescription: parsed.videoDescription,\\n    generatedAt: timeStr,\\n    dateLabel: dateStr,\\n    fileName: 'jelly-asmr-' + dateStr + '.mp4'\\n  }\\n}];","notice":""},"id":"2c3f73f3-9318-4ba8-a38e-734275b0f1a8","name":"Parse Gemini JSON","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[-864,640]},{"parameters":{"preBuiltAgentsCalloutHttpRequest":"","curlImport":"","method":"POST","url":"https://api.klingai.com/v1/videos/text2video","authentication":"none","provideSslCertificates":false,"sendQuery":false,"sendHeaders":true,"specifyHeaders":"keypair","headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"Authorization","value":"B