alid JSON.\\n    *   Constraints:\\n        *   Only valid, parseable JSON.\\n        *   Strings double-quoted.\\n        *   No comments.\\n        *   Single JSON object (not an array unless requested, though the system prompt says \\"if a user requests multiple... return array\\", here it's a single concept).\\n        *   No extra text, no markdown, no backticks.\\n        *   Must start with `{` and end with `}`.\\n    *   Fields: `prompt`, `videoTitle`, `videoDescription`.\\n\\n    *   Concept: Kinetic sand cutting or soap carving? No, let's go with something more modern/trendy. \\"Deep Cleaning an Extremely Dirty Rug\\" or \\"Cyberpunk-style futuristic gadget clicking\\". Let's go with \\"Satisfying Kinetic Sand Rainbow Cake Slicing with a Heated Knife\\".\\n\\n    *   `prompt`: \\"A close-up, top-down vertical shot of a multi-layered rainbow kinetic sand cake. A glowing, heated knife slowly slices through the layers, creating a crisp, crumbling sound. The colors are vibrant neon, and the background is a clean, matte black surface to make the colors pop. High frame rate for smooth motion.\\"\\n    *   `videoTitle`: \\"Satisfying Rainbow Sand Slicing 🌈🔪\\"\\n    *   `videoDescription`: \\"Wait for the end! The most satisfying rainbow crumble you've ever seen. 🎧 Use headphones for the best experience. #ASMR #Satisfying #KineticSand\\"\\n\\n    *   Valid JSON? Yes.\\n    *   Double quotes? Yes.\\n    *   No markdown? Yes.\\n    *   No backticks? Yes.\\n    *   Starts with `{` ends with `}`? Yes.","{\\n  \\"prompt\\": \\"A high-definition, extreme close-up vertical shot of a multi-layered rainbow kinetic sand cake sitting on a matte black surface. A glowing, heated knife slowly slices through the sand, causing the layers to crumble and fall away in satisfying, rhythmic chunks. The lighting is cinematic with a soft glow on the knife's edge, emphasizing the texture of the sand grains.\\",\\n  \\"videoTitle\\": \\"Rainbow Sand Slicing 🌈🔪 #Satisfying\\",\\n  \\"vide