ith colorful neon cubes and a high-quality microphone.\\n    *   Visual Scene (prompt): A close-up, top-down vertical shot of iridescent, translucent neon-colored ice cubes being slowly crushed by a heavy clear acrylic press. Micro-crystals shattering in slow motion, soft studio lighting reflecting off the ice surfaces, a high-sensitivity XLR microphone positioned just millimeters away to capture the sharp, crisp cracking sounds.\\n    *   Title: 🧊 NEON ICE CRUSH | Ultra Satisfying ASMR\\n    *   Description: Close your eyes and feel the crunch. The most satisfying neon ice breaking you've ever heard. 🎧 #ASMR #IceCrushing #Satisfying #OddlySatisfying\\n\\n    *   Check JSON keys: `prompt`, `videoTitle`, `videoDescription`.\\n    *   Check JSON structure: Valid JSON object.\\n    *   Remove markdown/backticks.","{\\n  \\"prompt\\": \\"A hyper-realistic, extreme close-up vertical shot of a transparent glass bowl filled with iridescent, kinetic sand pearls. A pair of metallic tweezers slowly picks up individual pearls and drops them onto a high-sensitivity microphone covered in a thin layer of clear silicone. The lighting is soft pastel neon, creating a dreamlike atmosphere with shallow depth of field, focusing on the texture of the sand and the vibration of the silicone membrane.\\",\\n  \\"videoTitle\\": \\"✨ Iridescent Sand Tingles | Deep Sleep ASMR\\",\\n  \\"videoDescription\\": \\"The most satisfying texture you've ever seen. 🎧 Wear headphones for the full 3D experience. #ASMR #Satisfying #KineticSand #SleepAid\\"\\n}"]	a7e4cb2c-7c9c-4ca4-8339-db9f05f1ce63
48	{"id":"LeagmHK_nal3-d2hiaOIn","name":"Kling AI Video Generator via PiAPI","active":false,"activeVersionId":null,"nodes":[{"parameters":{"notice":"","rule":{"interval":[{"field":"days","daysInterval":1,"triggerAtHour":0,"triggerAtMinute":0}]}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","typeVersion":1.3,"position":[0,0],"id":"a05d964a-34e6-4b64-94d1-71bfd238de82","name":"Schedule Trigger"},{"parameters":{"notice":"","schemaType":"fromJson","jsonSchemaExample":"{\\n\\"promp\\":\\"<insert generated promp here>\\",\\n\\"videoTitle\\":\\"<insert generated video title here>\\",\\n\\"videoDescription\\":\\"<insert generated video description here>\\"\\n}","autoFix":false},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured","typeVersion":1.3,"position":[352,208],"id":"754476f4-466e-4b4d-a813-d6e4d9f1f8e7","name":"Structured Output Parser"},{"parameters":{"notice":"","modelName":"models/gemini-2.5-flash","options":{}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","typeVersion":1,"position":[96,208],"id":"4852dd1f-d5cb-475f-b0ee-017184d9824c","name":"Google Gemini Chat Model","credentials":{"googlePalmApi":{"id":"B5Wm4iIJlAdZYfwY","name":"Google Gemini(PaLM) Api account"}}},{"parameters":{"notice":"","promptType":"define","text":"Generate ASMR","hasOutputParser":true,"needsFallback":false,"messages":{"messageValues":[{"type":"SystemMessagePromptTemplate","message":"=You are an expert at creating hyper-detailed, ASMR-style vertical video prompts for AI video generation tools (Runway, Kling, Luma, etc.).  Create ONE complete, ready-to-copy prompt for a vertical smartphone video (9:16 aspect ratio, physically shot in portrait mode — never simulate by cropping or rotating horizontal footage).  The subject must be: a whole, full-shaped [RANDOM FRUIT] made entirely of transparent jelly glass with a soft, light-colored outer hue that matches the real fruit's typical color but in a very pale, translucent version (for example: pale yellow-green for kiwi, gentle pinkish-red for dragon fruit, soft orange for persimmon, light purple for fig, etc.).  Rules that must stay exactly the same in every version: - The glass fruit is perfectly centered on a clean wooden cutting board - Studio lighting with subtle glowing highlights on the transparent jelly surface - A clearly visible human hand (neutral skin tone) holds a sharp stainless steel knife just above the fruit, poised to slice - Shot in ultra-sharp macro lens style with very shallow depth of field - Cinematic lighting, soft bokeh background, 4K quality, 30 FPS - In beautiful slow motion, the knife performs exactly two clean slices:   • First slice: front section breaks off cleanly with delicate jelly-crack and soft slicing ASMR sounds   • Immediately after: second slice cuts another smooth piece - A few tiny transparent jelly shards scatter lightly from both cuts - Only ASMR sounds: crisp jelly-glass cutting, subtle cracking, small shards falling — absolutely no talking, no voice, no background music, no other sound effects - Only the hand, knife, fruit and board are visible — nothing else enters the frame  Important: Choose a completely different realistic fruit for each prompt you generate (never repeat the same fruit — no Rambutan, and avoid repeating across generations). Examples of fruits to cycle through: kiwi, dragon fruit, persimmon, fig, lychee, passion fruit, starfruit, guava, pomegranate, apricot, plum, peach, mango, pear, strawberry (whole), etc.  At the end of each prompt you create, add these two extra lines:  Video Title: [Create a short, clickbait-attractive but clean English title that would work well for YouTube Shorts / TikTok / Instagram Reels — 5–10 words max]  Caption: [Create a short, engaging 1–2 sentence English caption that would be pasted under the video on social media, including 2–4 relevant hashtags]  Output only the single full prompt + the title + the caption — nothing else. Do not explain or add commentary.\\n\\nMake your output in json format:\\n{\\n\\"promp\\":\\"<insert generated promp here>\\",\\n\\"videoTitle\\":\\"<insert generated video title here>\\",\\n\\"videoDescription\\":\\"<insert generated video description here>\\"\\n}"}]},"batching":{}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm","typeVersion":1.9,"position":[208,0],"id":"e82e512d-549c-4523-9c2d-438c0bcec11b","name":"Generate Prompt"},{"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","language":"javaScript","jsCode":"return [\\n  {\\n  \\"type\\": \\"service_account\\",\\n  \\"project_id\\": \\"my-project-asmr-483803\\",\\n  \\"private_key_id\\": \\"60ac25a662328559cf71ebccce126c2047739e8f\\",\\n  \\"client_email\\": \\"asmr-video-creator-service-acc@my-project-asmr-483803.iam.gserviceaccount.com\\",\\n  \\"client_id\\": \\"100032661901089471171\\",\\n  \\"auth_uri\\": \\"https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/auth\\",\\n  \\"token_uri\\": \\"https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token\\",\\n  \\"auth_provider_x509_cert_url\\": \\"https://www.googleapis.com/oauth2/v1/certs\\",\\n  \\"client_x509_cert_url\\": \\"https://www.googleapis.com/robot/v1/metadata/x509/asmr-video-creator-service-acc%40my-project-asmr-483803.iam.gserviceaccount.com\\",\\n  \\"universe_domain\\": \\"googleapis.com\\"\\n}\\n]","notice":""},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[560,0],"id":"1e10c6f9-f3df-4c97-9f0c-a5aa95c9d5db","name":"Secret Payload"},{"parameters":{"operation":"sign","useJson":true,"claimsJson":"={\\n  \\"iss\\": \\"{{ $json.client_email }}\\",\\n  \\"scope\\": \\"https://www.googleapis.com/auth/cloud...\\",\\n  \\"aud\\": \\"https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token\\",\\n  \\"iat\\": {{ Math.floor($now.toSeconds()) }},\\n  \\"exp\\": {{ Math.floor($now.plus({ seconds: 3600 }).toSeconds()) }}\\n}","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.jwt","typeVersion":1,"position":[768,0],"id":"d196a1d6-ccc8-4670-bb16-526ab6ae3d02","name":"JWT","credentials":{"jwtAuth":{"id":"tjmNBhpI5x7qf11y","name":"JWT Auth account"}}},{"parameters":{"preBuiltAgentsCalloutHttpRequest":"","curlImport":"","method":"POST","url":"https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token","authentication":"none","provideSslCertificates":false,"sendQuery":false,"sendHeaders":false,"sendBody":true,"contentType":"form-urlencoded","specifyBody":"keypair","bodyParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"grant_type","value":"urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:jwt-bearer"},{"name":"assertion","value":"={{ $json.token }}"}]},"options":{},"infoMessage":""},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.3,"position":[976,0],"id":"38b6c48d-bc96-4517-856b-f7b1b447b9ad","name":"HTTP Request"},{"parameters":{"preBuiltAgentsCalloutHttpRequest":"","curlImport":"","method":"POST","url":"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemma-4-31b-it:generateContent","authentication":"none","provideSslCertificates":false,"sendQuery":true,"specifyQuery":"keypair","queryParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"key","value":"AIzaSyBUG5uH5X52NHVQzKKmin8wzQKkf-fFzTk"}]},"sendHeaders":true,"specifyHeaders":"keypair","headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}]},"sendBody":true,"contentType":"json","specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"{\\n  \\"contents\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\"parts\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\"text\\": \\"Generate a viral ASMR vertical video concept.\\\\n\\\\nReturn ONLY valid JSON.\\\\n\\\\nFORMAT:\\\\n{\\\\n  \\\\\\"prompt\\\\\\": \\\\\\"detailed ASMR visual scene\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\"videoTitle\\\\\\": \\\\\\"viral short title\\\\\\",\\\\n  \\\\\\"videoDescription\\\\\\": \\\\\\"short engaging description\\\\\\"\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nRules:\\\\n- No explanations\\\\n- No markdown\\\\n- No backticks\\\\n- Must start with { and end with }\\\\n\\\\nGenerate now.\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\"generationConfig\\": {\\n    \\"temperature\\": 0.9,\\n    \\"maxOutputTokens\\": 800,\\n    \\"response_mime_type\\": \\"application/json\\"\\n  }\\n}","options":{},"infoMessage":""},"id":"6ba1b945-f270-4980-ac42-23f2404be668","name":"Gemini – Generate Prompt","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.2,"position":[-1104,640]},{"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","language":"javaScript","jsCode":"// ================================\\n// 🧠 ULTRA SELF-HEALING GEMINI PARSER\\n// ================================\\n\\nconst MAX_RETRIES = 3;\\nconst retryCount = $json.retryCount || 0;\\n\\nconst geminiResponse = $input.first().json;\\n\\n// STEP 1: SAFE EXTRACTION\\nlet rawText = '';\\ntry {\\n  rawText = geminiResponse?.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text || '';\\n} catch (e) {\\n  throw new Error('NO_GEMINI_RESPONSE');\\n}\\n\\nif (!rawText || rawText.length < 5) {\\n  throw new Error('EMPTY_RESPONSE');\\n}\\n\\n// STEP 2: CLEAN TEXT\\nrawText = rawText\\n  .replace(/```json/gi, '')\\n  .replace(/```/g, '')\\n  .replace(/\\\\r/g, '')\\n  .trim();\\n\\n// STEP 3: EXTRACT JSON BLOCK (VERY IMPORTANT)\\nconst jsonMatch = rawText.match(/\\\\{[\\\\s\\\\S]*\\\\}/);\\n\\nif (!jsonMatch) {\\n  console.log('❌ NO JSON FOUND:', rawText);\\n\\n  if (retryCount < MAX_RETRIES) {\\n    throw new Error(`RETRY_NO_JSON_${retryCount + 1}`);\\n  } else {\\n    throw new Error('FINAL_NO_JSON');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nlet cleanJson = jsonMatch[0];\\n\\n// STEP 4: FIX COMMON JSON ISSUES\\ncleanJson = cleanJson\\n  .replace(/\\\\n/g, ' ')\\n  .replace(/\\\\t/g, ' ')\\n  .replace(/,\\\\s*}/g, '}') // trailing comma\\n  .replace(/,\\\\s*]/g, ']')\\n  .replace(/\\\\\\\\+\\"/g, '\\"')\\n  .replace(/\\"{2,}/g, '\\"')\\n  .trim();\\n\\n// STEP 5: AUTO-CLOSE JSON IF CUT\\nconst openBraces = (cleanJson.match(/{/g) || []).length;\\nconst closeBraces = (cleanJson.match(/}/g) || []).length;\\n\\nif (openBraces > closeBraces) {\\n  cleanJson += '}'.repeat(openBraces - closeBraces);\\n}\\n\\n// STEP 6: MULTI-TRY PARSE\\nlet parsed = null;\\n\\nconst tryParse = (text) => {\\n  try {\\n    return JSON.parse(text);\\n  } catch {\\n    return null;\\n  }\\n};\\n\\n// attempt 1\\nparsed = tryParse(cleanJson);\\n\\n// attempt 2 (remove weird chars)\\nif (!parsed) {\\n  parsed = tryParse(cleanJson.replace(/[^\\\\x20-\\\\x7E]+/g, ''));\\n}\\n\\n// attempt 3 (hard trim)\\nif (!parsed) {\\n  const shorter = cleanJson.substring(0, cleanJson.lastIndexOf('}') + 1);\\n  parsed = tryParse(shorter);\\n}\\n\\n// FINAL FAIL → RETRY\\nif (!parsed) {\\n  console.log('❌ FINAL RAW:', cleanJson);\\n\\n  if (retryCount < MAX_RETRIES) {\\n    throw new Error(`RETRY_PARSE_FAIL_${retryCount + 1}`);\\n  } else {\\n    throw new Error('FINAL_PARSE_FAILED');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n// STEP 7: VALIDATE STRUCTURE\\nif (!parsed.prompt || !parsed.videoTitle || !parsed.videoDescription) {\\n\\n  console.log('⚠️ INVALID STRUCTURE:', parsed);\\n\\n  if (retryCount < MAX_RETRIES) {\\n    throw new Error(`RETRY_INVALID_STRUCTURE_${retryCount + 1}`);\\n  } else {\\n    throw new Error('FINAL_INVALID_STRUCTURE');\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n// STEP 8: SUCCESS OUTPUT\\nconst now = new Date();\\n\\nreturn [{\\n  json: {\\n    prompt: parsed.prompt,\\n    videoTitle: parsed.videoTitle,\\n    videoDescription: parsed.videoDescription,\\n    generatedAt: now.toISOString(),\\n    dateLabel: now.toISOString().split('T')[0],\\n    fileName: 'jelly-asmr-' + now.toISOString().split('T')[0] + '.mp4',\\n    retryCount,\\n    status: 'success'\\n  }\\n}];","notice":""},"id":"2c3f73f3-9318-4ba8-a38e-734275b0f1a8","name":"Parse Gemini JSON","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[-864,640]},{"parameters":{"preBuiltAgentsCalloutHttpRequest":"","curlImport":"","method":"POST","url":"https://kling26ai.com/api/generate","authentication":"none","provideSslCertificates":false,"sendQuery":false,"sendHeaders":true,"specifyHeaders":"keypair","headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"Authorization","value":"Bearer sk-1936ac02b0f245cf811c6afcf8ea666c"},{"name":"Content-Type","value":"application/json"}]},"sendBody":true,"contentType":"json","specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={\\n  \\"model\\": \\"kling-v1\\",\\n  \\"prompt\\": \\"{{ $json.prompt }}\\",\\n  \\"negative_prompt\\": \\"text overlay, watermark, subtitles, music, voice, talking, background music, logos, blur, low quality, horizontal video\\",\\n  \\"cfg_scale\\": 0.5,\\n  \\"mode\\": \\"std\\",\\n  \\"aspect_ratio\\": \\"9:16\\",\\n  \\"duration\\": \\"5\\"\\n}","options":{},"infoMessage":""},"id":"442492e8-c402-435f-b4e1-78228ddec395","name":"Kling AI – Submit Video","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.2,"position":[-624,640]},{"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","language":"javaScript","jsCode":"// Store the task_id from Kling response alongside the prompt data\\nconst klingResponse = $input.item.json;\\n\\nlet taskId = '';\\ntry {\\n  taskId = klingResponse.data.task_id;\\n} catch(e) {\\n  throw new Error('Could not get task_id from Kling: ' + JSON.stringify(klingResponse));\\n}\\n\\n// Pull through all data from the Parse node\\nconst prev = $('Parse Gemini JSON').item.json;\\n\\nreturn [{\\n  json: {\\n    prompt: prev.prompt,\\n    videoTitle: prev.videoTitle,\\n    videoDescription: prev.videoDescription,\\n    generatedAt: prev.generatedAt,\\n    dateLabel: prev.dateLabel,\\n    fileName: prev.fileName,\\n    taskId: taskId,\\n    klingStatus: 'submitted'\\n  }\\n}];","notice":""},"id":"c30a4157-d7c9-4cae-9808-9ba885fd0fd3","name":"Store Task ID","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[-384,640]},{"parameters":{"resume":"timeInterval","amount":5,"unit":"minutes"},"id":"0f071b7f-ebf3-4ac2-a2d9-bedcfba78243","name":"Wait 5 Min","type":"n8n-nodes-base.wait","typeVersion":1.1,"position":[-144,640],"webhookId":"wait-webhook-jelly-1"},{"parameters":{"preBuiltAgentsCalloutHttpRequest":"","curlImport":"","method":"GET","url":"=https://api.klingai.com/v1/videos/text2video/{{ $json.taskId }}","authentication":"none","provideSslCertificates":false,"sendQuery":false,"sendHeaders":true,"specifyHeaders":"keypair","headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"Authorization","value":"Bearer YOUR_KLING_API_KEY_HERE"}]},"sendBody":false,"optio