 flower coated in a thin layer of frost. A perfectly clear, warm glass sphere slowly descends and touches the petals, causing a satisfying, crystalline crackle as the ice shatters in slow motion. Soft, warm lighting contrasting with cool blue ice tones, shallow depth of field, hyper-realistic textures.\\"\\n    *   `videoTitle`: \\"Ice Shatter ASMR ❄️\\"\\n    *   `videoDescription`: \\"Wait for the crack... 🤤 Pure satisfaction. #ASMR #OddlySatisfying #IceShatter\\"\\n\\n    *   Valid JSON? Yes.\\n    *   Double-quoted strings? Yes.\\n    *   No markdown? Yes.\\n    *   No backticks? Yes.\\n    *   No extra text? Yes.","{\\n  \\"prompt\\": \\"Extreme close-up, macro 4K vertical shot. A delicate, frozen crystal flower coated in a thin layer of shimmering frost. A perfectly clear, warm glass sphere slowly descends and touches the petals, causing a satisfying, crystalline crackle as the ice shatters in slow motion. Soft, warm gold lighting contrasting with cool neon blue ice tones, shallow depth of field, hyper-realistic textures of ice shards flying.\\",\\n  \\"videoTitle\\": \\"Ice Shatter ASMR ❄️\\",\\n  \\"videoDescription\\": \\"Wait for the crack... 🤤 Pure satisfaction. #ASMR #OddlySatisfying #IceShatter #Macro\\"\\n}"]	643ce3eb-2fb1-4b60-98c5-e76bea404d2f
